"P330603100" "This disc, filled with CAD files, contains all the plans for the Sky Raider's new prototype missile launcher."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1614927078" "Before we really get started, just let me say that I am really looking forward to working with you. You see, I am an individual interested in opportunity. In order to reach my career goals within Arachnos, I need to seek out and achieve successes beyond the limits of my basic responsibilities. To do this, I need to employ talented and self-motivated contractors such as yourself.  And you know, <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I just happen to have learned about a situation that could be leveraged to our mutual benefit involving the Sky Raiders.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3526211533" "Take advantage of Vargas's opportunity"
// SendOffString :
"P3140095375" "Great! I knew you were a real go-getter. A real achiever! So here's the situation: the Sky Raiders are working on a new missile launcher for their Sky Skiffs. Now, one of our people was supposed to sabotage that program, but he made a bad play and dropped the ball. This means we, you and I, have a chance to shine. Here's the plan: I want you to get into the Sky Raider base where they're holding the prototype launcher, steal it and the plans for it, and then, ah, 'negate the future productivity' of the guy in charge of the project. Just bring the launcher and the plans to me afterwards. <br>Great? <br>Great!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1199141973" "Take prototype launcher"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3615658347" "Look, I know that you are a professional. And I have every confidence in your ability. So, go out there and get 'em!  Bring me that prototype!"

