// Task - SL4_SI_Vargas_Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - CorLeonisData 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2733767936" "Council enhancement programs"
// DetailString :
"P2481986393" "This computer report contains some information on the numerous programs the Council has in place to enhance their soldiers. <br>The Cor Leonis enhancement line uses drugs, minor cybernetics, advanced surgery techniques, and retro-viral genetic tailoring to enhance a human soldier. It was originally developed by Nosferatu. <br>The Vampyri are also enhanced human soldiers, enhanced to the point of near inhumanity. These were also developed by Nosferatu. <br>The Galaxy and Void Hunters were developed using something called Nictus Fragments. Alien technology used by Arakhn. <br>War Wolves use Nictus fragments in a different, more primal way. They were created by Requiem himself."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3182872382" "I like to think that everyone is born with potential ability. What sets people like you and me apart from everyone else, though, is that we are prepared to take that potential ability, and actualize it. Some people, like the Council, have the means of actualizing abilities through things like their super-soldier program. And that's where the trouble starts. Arachnos tries to maintain a stable space with the Council so that we can choose when to stage conflicts. Right now, there's an instability forming because of the Council's growing ranks of enhanced 'Cor Leonis' soldiers. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>The higher-ups haven't said anything, but I know that they'd be relieved if that instability was removed. Along with a lab that produces chemicals for the Cor Leonis process.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1538206764" "Remove Council Lab"
// SendOffString :
"P550224241" "The entire lab has to be liquidated. You'll need to forcibly disrupt their computer network, liquidate their inventory, and terminate the contracts of their personnel to the maximum degree. You're a pro, so I know that I can leave this whole thing to your discretion."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1360223205" "Defeat everyone in Lab"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4244517184" "That Lab is the barrier blocking you from your full potential, and I want you to go and smash right through it!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3273216629" "Much of this lab seems geared towards scientific work. Too bad they didn't concentrate more on their defenses."

