"P561089791" "Honestly, I'm jealous of you. You're out there, cracking heads and getting into the action. Me, I mostly just push papers and write the reports. And this report, it's gonna be a good one. The Council has taken a serious hit to their bottom line, and their entire production schedule is going to be off track for weeks. Now if you'll excuse me, I have the chance of a lifetime to capitalize on."
