// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1227589676" "That was just beautiful work, {VillainName}. The Tsoo's unlicensed smuggling has been 'disincentivised', both sides are blaming each other, and I'm going to get everything I want at the bargaining table. My projections are rising, my capital's up, and it's all thanks to you. I'm sure you noticed that I've wired the money to your account, and you have earned every bit. You're such a go-getter. I feel like I'm running just to keep up with you. And I mean that. Sincerely."
// RandomFameString :
"P1571316600" "Looks like things are getting stirred up between the Tsoo and the Family."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_SI_Vargas_Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P475065412" "You know me, {VillainName}. I'm a reasonable guy. But one thing I cannot stand is people who make it their business to obstruct business. Government regulators, unions, environmental agencies, and oh yes, unlicensed vigilantes. Vigilantes. You know. 'Heroes'. I so hate that term. Just because these people decide to enforce some outmoded paradigm of so-called 'morality', they get to be the good guys. You know what? I say that's wrong. You and me, we're the good guys. We're the ones actualizing the outcomes we want to see instead of being mired in tired methodology. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want these vigilantes out of here. I want their allies to see them fail. And I want you to make that happen.</A> This could be tough, but I know that you can and will thrive on this challenge."
// AcceptString :
"P1922804201" "Send vigilantes packing."
// SendOffString :
"P248292920" "The two people you're looking for are a pair of vigilantes called Blue Phazer and Golden Sphinx. Sphinx is supposed to be really tough, and Blue Phazer has some kind of energy powers. Take them both out. You can leave most of the others if you want, I wouldn't mind seeing their whole world-view get thrown out."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P889727169" "Defeat the vigilantes"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3159981677" "Those two self-appointed moralists are starting to inspire the locals. That just can't be allowed. Deal with them. Both of them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2905065196" "Vargas said that this was just a hideout. If this is a 'hideout', you'd hate to see a full base!"

